    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies award the most contracts in Tennessee?",
      "a": "The Department of Energy awards the most contracts in Tennessee, with $7.4B in obligations. The Department of Defense follows with $1.6B, the Department of Justice with $726M, and the Department of Veterans Affairs with $541M. Several other agencies contribute smaller shares, including HHS $261M and DHS $207M."
